  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Introducing Good Aura Co. A candle and wax melt brand, with a scent that actually lasts once lit, with a groovy twist!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Based in our Surrey Studio, all our candles and wax melts are hand-poured by us to create a scent that you'll love that actually lasts. They melt evenly too and our large candles are refillable, with any future affiliate codes applicable for reorders!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Each of our 7 curated scents is designed to match a mood or aura, and is available in our wax melts, tin size or large refills. Our best selling scent is Black Amber and Lavender, a beautiful purple haze blend designed to destress you. Perfect lit during a meditation practice, your self-care Sunday routine or for a cozy night in.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Affiliates would be paid within 30 days after an order has passed the returns period, via PayPal or Bank Transfer. We really encourage sharing on TikTok or &nbsp;Instagram especially and would reshare any content, tagging you. But feel free to share on other platforms!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our candles and wax melts really stand out to women in their early 20s - 40s, who are passionate about sustainable, female founded, trending brands.&nbsp;</p>",
